---
title: Imaginary Circles
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Imaginary Circles</title>
<meta name="description" content="An interactive series on radians, waves, e, i, pi, and the road from a rotating point to quantum mechanics.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: hsl(215, 26%, 7%);
    --bg-elevated: hsl(215, 24%, 10%);
    --line: hsl(215, 18%, 22%);
    --line-soft: hsl(215, 18%, 16%);
    --ink: hsl(210, 32%, 93%);
    --ink-dim: hsl(212, 15%, 58%);
    --ink-faint: hsl(212, 14%, 38%);
    --accent: hsl(199, 92%, 62%);
    --accent-b: hsl(174, 70%, 55%);
    --accent-glow: hsla(199, 92%, 62%, 0.30);
    --display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html,body{background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);}
  body{padding:72px 24px 100px; font-family:var(--mono); -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
  .page{max-width:1040px; margin:0 auto;}

  .eyebrow{font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .eyebrow::before{content:''; width:22px; height:1px; background:var(--accent);}
  h1{font-family:var(--display); font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px); letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.05; margin-bottom:20px;}
  h1 span{color:var(--accent-b);}
  .hero-mark{display:inline-block; width:0.94em; height:0.94em; vertical-align:-0.1em; margin-right:0.3em; overflow:visible;}
  .hero-mark .ic-rings{transform-box:view-box; transform-origin:24px 24px; animation:ic-rings-spin 26s linear infinite;}
  .hero-mark .ic-r1{animation:ic-ring-pulse 6.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .hero-mark .ic-r2{animation:ic-ring-pulse 6.5s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay:2.16s;}
  .hero-mark .ic-r3{animation:ic-ring-pulse 6.5s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay:4.33s;}
  @keyframes ic-rings-spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  @keyframes ic-ring-pulse{0%,100%{opacity:0.68;} 50%{opacity:1;}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .hero-mark .ic-rings, .hero-mark .ic-r1, .hero-mark .ic-r2, .hero-mark .ic-r3{animation:none;} }
  .sub{font-family:var(--display); font-size:16px; color:var(--ink-dim); max-width:660px; line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:56px;}

  .grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1px; background:var(--line-soft); border:1px solid var(--line-soft);}
  .card{
    display:block; text-decoration:none; color:inherit;
    background:var(--bg-elevated); padding:26px 28px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:64px 1fr; gap:22px; align-items:baseline;
    transition:background 0.18s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{background:hsl(215,22%,13%);}
  .card:hover .card-title{color:var(--accent);}
  .num{font-family:var(--display); font-weight:700; font-size:28px; color:var(--ink-faint); line-height:1;}
  .card:hover .num{color:var(--accent-b);}
  .card-title{font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:20px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:8px; transition:color 0.18s ease;}
  .card-blurb{font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-dim); line-height:1.6; max-width:640px;}
  .arrow{color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:15px;}

  footer{margin-top:56px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); letter-spacing:0.04em; line-height:1.7;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="eyebrow">An interactive series</div>
    <h1><svg class="hero-mark" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs><linearGradient id="ic-rings-hero" x1="8" y1="10" x2="40" y2="40" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <stop stop-color="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)"/>
      </linearGradient></defs>
      <!-- static coordinate frame (real / imaginary axes) -->
      <g class="ic-axes">
        <line x1="1.5" y1="24" x2="46.5" y2="24" stroke="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" stroke-opacity="0.2" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="0.5 3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="24" y1="1.5" x2="24" y2="46.5" stroke="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" stroke-opacity="0.2" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="0.5 3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </g>
      <!-- rotating construction -->
      <g class="ic-rings">
        <path d="M24 17.5 L18.37 27.25 L29.63 27.25 Z" stroke="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" stroke-opacity="0.4" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <line x1="24" y1="17.5" x2="24" y2="4" stroke="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" stroke-opacity="0.45" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="18.37" y1="27.25" x2="6.68" y2="34" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-opacity="0.45" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="29.63" y1="27.25" x2="41.32" y2="34" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-opacity="0.45" stroke-width="0.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle class="ic-r1" cx="24" cy="17.5" r="13.5" stroke="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" stroke-width="1" fill="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" fill-opacity="0.09"/>
        <circle class="ic-r2" cx="18.37" cy="27.25" r="13.5" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-width="1" fill="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" fill-opacity="0.09"/>
        <circle class="ic-r3" cx="29.63" cy="27.25" r="13.5" stroke="url(#ic-rings-hero)" stroke-width="1" fill="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)" fill-opacity="0.09"/>
        <circle cx="10.56" cy="16.24" r="1.3" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        <circle cx="37.44" cy="16.24" r="1.3" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="39.52" r="1.3" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="17.5" r="1.1" fill="var(--accent, #5ac4ff)"/>
        <circle cx="18.37" cy="27.25" r="1.1" fill="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)"/>
        <circle cx="29.63" cy="27.25" r="1.1" fill="var(--accent-b, #46d2be)"/>
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="1.35" fill="var(--ink, #e7edf3)"/>
      </g>
    </svg>Imaginary <span>Circles</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Start with the angle where an arc equals its radius, then follow that one rotating point all the way to quantum mechanics — through waves, Fourier series, <em>e</em>, <em>i</em>, pi, and Feynman's spinning arrows.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      {% for part in parts %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ part.slug }}.html">
        <span class="num">{{ part.num }}</span>
        <span>
          <span class="card-title">{{ part.title }}</span>
          <span class="card-blurb">{{ part.blurb }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
